Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Most values below are Entra/work-account (AAD) scoped and may show as "not applied"
; in edge://policy on a personal Microsoft-account profile. Only GenAILocalFoundationalModelSettings
; and Microsoft365CopilotChatIconEnabled are confirmed to apply to MSA profiles. Kept anyway:
; Windows launches Edge on its own for help links, Search/Settings deep links and PDFs.
;
; EdgeCopilotEnabled, CopilotAddressBarSuggestionsEnabled, CopilotNewTabPageEnabled and
; AIGenThemesEnabled below are all MSA-scoped "No" (per their own policy pages), so they
; only take effect with Edge sign-in disabled - see Disable_Edge_Signin_And_Sync.reg.
[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\Edge]
"CopilotPageContext"=dword:00000000
"HubsSidebarEnabled"=dword:00000000
"Microsoft365CopilotChatIconEnabled"=dword:00000000
"EdgeEntraCopilotPageContext"=dword:00000000
"EdgeHistoryAISearchEnabled"=dword:00000000
"ComposeInlineEnabled"=dword:00000000
"GenAILocalFoundationalModelSettings"=dword:00000001
"NewTabPageBingChatEnabled"=dword:00000000
"EdgeCopilotEnabled"=dword:00000000
"CopilotAddressBarSuggestionsEnabled"=dword:00000000
"CopilotNewTabPageEnabled"=dword:00000000
"AIGenThemesEnabled"=dword:00000000
